<Text>if(2 == MTI_Type) Type = 1; else Type = 0; end&#x000D;&#x000A;if(0 == Type) Pulse_Offset=1; else Pulse_Offset=2; end&#x000D;&#x000A;MTI_NumOfPulse = NumOfPulse + Pulse_Offset;&#x000D;&#x000A;if(0 == MTI_Type) Condition = 0; else Condition = 1; end</Text>
<UnitUse><T>Int</T><D>2</D></UnitUse>
